{"id":"4021627222448544094","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"我对Weeknd的忠诚程度就是高考前自己手搓了曼谷的票，去曼谷看演唱会没敢给父母说然后浦东飞曼谷的时候被海关劝返了，机酒和演唱会票全部作废，被父母大骂一顿之后 立马就看香港场的票和机酒立马下单，曼谷和香港都是三天极限往返全部红眼航班，三天里面一天通宵一天赶飞机。我妈现在都不知道我去香港看演唱会了虽然我已经回来了","username":"xingyihuang904","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@xingyihuang904/post/DfPsKa9Fhle","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:02:25Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:25.367983807Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_a0d997a3ba82c418","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4021628882369759821","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"在Vaundy演唱會看到洋流的一些有的沒的東西\n想說好吧都是橘色…只能說是蠻剛好 \n可能只是想增加應援色\n結果看到防彈演唱會洋流也想搞？？？\n完全法克 演唱會甚至在高雄 \n你們真的想都別想 我在搖滾區一個一個打掉\n台北市民我本人今天決定投蔣萬安。","username":"2sad22dance","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@2sad22dance/post/DfPsik4GcpN","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:05:43Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:16.733451472Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_ed9ad3f45996fa2d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4021631889056925503","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"這次看到Jason Mraz 的演唱會，以及前陣子Big Bang的演唱會都有超多體驗極差的分享文，這不僅是花錢當冤大頭，同時也影響台灣辦國際活動的名聲，主辦單位很重要，也應該要負責。\n\n我想蓋個樓，希望脆友們可以分享哪些主辦單位很雷，建議避開，避免您開心花錢支持歌手，卻敗興而歸。","username":"_roderick2345","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@_roderick2345/post/DfPtOVEnwc_","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:11:42Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:16.733394716Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_096edf1bc325af9d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4021640775654678671","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"看到有人說要在 BTS 手燈上綁洋流飄帶，\n老實說看了真的很躁\n\n演唱會是粉絲與偶像之間的約定，\n不是什麼大型政治造勢場合欸。\n\n多少 ARMY 等了這麼多年，\n好不容易等到七個人合體，\n結果 ARMY Bomb 還要兼職選舉旗桿？\n\n理想國過往入場規範第 13 點就寫了：\n「禁止攜帶含有政治性標語的旗幟、橫幅。」\n\n你支持誰是你的自由，\n但可以不要連追星都要搞政治嗎？\n\n政治已經滲透生活夠多地方了，\n能不能把這三天好好留給 ARMY？\n\n拜託，台上的是 BTS\n不是你的市長候選人欸==","username":"kinji_gb7","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@kinji_gb7/post/DfPvPpXH6CP","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:29:21Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:16.733414847Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:40.406473Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_5df86af44c62061d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
